      "message": "I independently ran into the optional-image case and tested it end to end in QEMU (p10bmc build, rainier-bmc machine, eMMC boot, field mode enabled, with a stand-in image-hostfw signed by the build). The tested code was d194ee8a with my equivalent partition-path check backported, not this change itself.\n\nWithout the fix: a package with a modified image-rofs (signatures unchanged) plus a valid image-hostfw was accepted. The BMC rebooted into the modified rofs (3/3 runs).\nWith the fix: the same package was rejected (Activation Failed, nothing written, no service restart, 3/3). An unmodified package still updated and rebooted.\n\nHope this helps the review.",
